# Normalize line endings to LF on every platform. Without this, Windows
# checkouts (autocrlf) convert text files to CRLF, which breaks byte-exact and
# regex-based tests — notably the plugin content-lock hash and the
# manual-hooks.md fenced-block parse in plugin-consistency.test.ts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
